  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Everything''s prepped. Fuel lines topped. Cryo calibrated. Autopilot synced
    for the long haul


    I still can''t believe this is happening. You, marked
    non grata for something we both know was a frame job. The Coalition made their
    mind up before your trial even began.


    So we vanish. Not running... Relocating.
    To Station Theta-7, far past Coalition reach. Where maybe you get to stop looking
    over your shoulder.


    I set the ship to wake us just before arrival. In case
    you forget the password to the cockpit after sleeping like a princess, try our
    <color=red>arrival year</color>. See you on the other side.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0c6fc018bc35d940a273121f8a952ac, type: 2}
